  "independent_scope": "Whole native selected-source content on both mattes, all9 selected poses plus adopted neutral at inherited maximum body reference 891.472868px across5both-matte pages, and all7 decoded discrete recipe rows actually viewed. Historical unselected sheet cells are not accepted by viewing their whole source. Physical UI zoom/density and real-time/interpolated/MP4 output not measured.",
  "observations": "Selected all9 fresh singles and adopted neutral were actually inspected on native light/dark composites and at inherited maximum891.472868px on5both-matte pages, followed by all7 decoded recipe strips. Warm chestnut body, large paired pink-inner ears, two short cream ossicones with brown tips, cream muzzle/cheeks and white eye surrounds with brown pupils are consistent. Closed blink preserves the usual crown, jaw, torso and foot layout without the rejected prototype elongation; facial expression alone changes intentionally. Greeting and left/right presentations use connected forelegs with appropriate gaze and direction. Think forehoof meets chin, aha raises one connected forehoof, and cheer raises both; clean transparent gaps under arms are not holes in the body. The two species phases are small head/ear settling gestures, not asserted locomotion. Forearm and leg cream banding, paired cloven hooves, and one side tail with dark tuft remain recognizable and connected. Native bounded watercolor texture is intentional; no broad dirty color field, cuts, duplicated eye/limb or malformed ear/hoof was seen. All9 remain clear at891.47px with no resolution blur. Head tilt changes projections in the gestures but no obvious body-scale or foot-support regression was visible. Recipe return states retain the exact adopted neutral; no obvious doubled limbs or discontinuous body stretch was visible in the discrete strips.",
  "cautions": [
    "Still native/max-scale composites and decoded discrete key-pose strips were inspected. Real-time playback, interpolation and final MP4 are outside this review.",
